    {
      "id": "u_092acc367b178a67e81b57ea_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The view types dictate how the child notes are represented. By default, the notes will be displayed in a grid, however there are also some other view types available.",
      "sourceHash": "092acc367b178a67e81b57ea22479532b42d64d10bff8e3eada87f02b4dbb9d6",
      "context": "Note List > View types",
      "contextHash": "d19b8a3312181e3497d1ad6ecab99b01b70f9b353a45e4bb46fedb900e348b52",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_3bfb0a599830e29fdb6b31fd_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Generally the view type can only be changed from the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Collection Properties__TRILIUM_PH_1__, but it can also be changed manually on any type of note using the __TRILIUM_PH_2__ __TRILIUM_PH_3__label__TRILIUM_PH_4__.",
      "sourceHash": "3bfb0a599830e29fdb6b31fd75873abed3dbf7a79ec4ed0c3ec5e0edbd953fe7",
      "context": "Note List > View types",
      "contextHash": "d19b8a3312181e3497d1ad6ecab99b01b70f9b353a45e4bb46fedb900e348b52",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_3a50ec4e430a467fcf838c98_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Saved searches use __TRILIUM_PH_0__Search preview__TRILIUM_PH_1__ by default: it draws each result as a snippet card with the text and attributes that matched. It is limited to search notes and is described in __TRILIUM_PH_2__Search__TRILIUM_PH_3__.",
      "sourceHash": "3a50ec4e430a467fcf838c98ee6a679ca0ab4757dca8e20ab74c1da54826defe",
